@housing_corp
title: A Housing Crown
subtitle: Establish a Crown corporation responsible for constructing and managing affordable housing, particularly for low-income families, elderly residents, and workers moving into industrial centres.

@housing_finance
title: Financing Housing
subtitle: Provide low-interest loans, loan guarantees, and other financial assistance for home construction and renovation 

@attract_industry
title: Incentivizing Development
subtitle: Attract private industry in secondary sectors by issuing generous grants and loans through the [? if year <= 1962 : Industrial Development Office ?][? if year > 1962 : Saskatchewan Economic Development Corporation ?] [? if year >= 1962 : <br>This will aid in the development of IPSCO and the Saskatchewan Cement Corporation  ?]

@progressive_taxation
title: Implementing Progressive Taxation
subtitle: The federal government has decentralized the income tax system; implement a progressive tax reduction, decreasing tax on low- and middle-income earners and raising taxes for corporations and high earners –> only after and during 1962

@beautification
title: Beautification
subtitle: “Beautify” the major streets and avenues of Saskatoon, Regina, and various small towns 

@provincial_parks
title: Expanding Provincial Parks and Conservation Areas
subtitle: Set aside land for conservation and provincial parks; develop public recreational facilities in rural areas

@cooperative_technical_aid
title: Aiding Cooperatives
subtitle: Provide further technical and operational assistance to developing cooperatives

@cooperative_tax_aid
title: Aiding Cooperatives
subtitle: Provide tax incentives and relief to developing cooperatives


